      "report_date": "2026-11-25",
      "title": "3,821 Philippine casino sites frame Coruna and DarkSword",
      "summary": "Coruna and DarkSword iOS exploit kits are being delivered through a network of at least 3,821 Philippine online-casino sites that all promote one casino through a single affiliate link. Starting 10 November 2026, the sites carry a hidden one-pixel iframe that loads a router page on channel G.J.LJ, which selects an exploit chain based on the visitor's iOS version. iOS 17 and desktop or Android visitors receive the Coruna dispatcher, while iOS 18.4 to 18.7.2 visitors are routed to the DarkSword loader. Channel G.J.LJ is the only router build in the researchers' captures that logs exploit results and ten-minute survival heartbeats to measure whether iOS kills the tab. The operator registered failover domains and staged router hosts in pairs, with the affiliate network dating back about a year.",
